85	/// A nested `$` or `{` inside a placeholder body, or an unclosed
86	/// `${...`, leaves the input verbatim. [`NoEnv`] would also return
87	/// `None` for any lookup, but the parser must short-circuit
88	/// *before* the lookup, so swapping in a richer fake would still
89	/// be a no-op.
